        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "a0e1c8b3-3641-51e4-bc19-a61a46ec890a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Rescuers, The Muppets\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions, Buena Vista Distribution\n- People: Jeanette Nolan\n- Roles: Ellie Mae, Widow Tweed\n- Topics: film genres, release dates, television and film credits\n\nFacts:\n- Jeanette Nolan appeared in the film \"Macbeth\" in 1948.\n- Jeanette Nolan was best known for roles in the television series \"The Virginian\" from 1962 to 1971 and \"Dirty Sally\" in 1974.\n- \"The Rescuers\" is a 1977 American animated comedy-drama adventure film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- \"The Rescuers\" was first released on June 22, 1977, by Buena Vista Distribution.\n- Jeanette Nolan voiced Ellie Mae in the Disney animated film \"The Rescuers\" in 1977.\n- Jeanette Nolan voiced Widow Tweed in the Disney animated film \"The Fox and the Hound\" in 1981.\n- \"The Muppets\" is a 2011 American musical comedy film.\n- \"The Muppets\" was the seventh theatrical film featuring the Muppets.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
